# Verity

Verity is an AI-powered Discord chatbot built with Node.js,
Discord.js, and OpenRouter.

## Features

- 🤖 AI-powered Discord conversations
- 💬 `/openbox` to start a conversation
- 🔒 `/closebox` to stop the conversation
- 🧠 Conversation memory
- ⚡ OpenRouter model support
- 🔐 Environment-variable API keys
- 🪶 Lightweight Node.js setup

## Requirements

- Node.js 18+
- A Discord bot application
- A Discord bot token
- An OpenRouter API key

## Installation

```bash
git clone YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL
cd verity-discord-ai
npm install
